      "message": "After thinking about this, I have some concerns that this might make our stale data slightly worse for user builds in isolation.\n\nConsider the following scenario:\n\n1. User does a regular build with `m`, all metrics files are generated and uploaded fine\n2. User does `m bp2build`, note that shouldCollectBuildSoongMetrics is false for this build\n\nBefore your CL, we wouldn\u0027t see stale metrics for soong_build\u0027s metrics as included in soong_metrics, because, with shouldCollectBuildSoongMetrics returning false, we don\u0027t load soong_build_metrics.pb and don\u0027t include it in soong_metrics.\n\nAfter your CL, we would see stale metrics in soong_build_metrics.pb\n\n\n\nI think we can fix this inline in your CL if we delete soong_build_metrics.pb with every build (not just ones where shouldCollectBuildSoongMetrics is true).",
